    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ei idi ndelanganyi ya Esau (dina diandi dikuabo Edome). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau wakabaka bakashi ba bana bakashi ba Bena Kanana: Adamuana wa bakashi wa Elona, Muena Hiti, ne Oholibama, muana wa bakashi wa Ana, muana wa bakashi wa Sibiona, Muena Hiwi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne Basemata, muana wa bakashi wa Yishemaele, ne muan abo wa bakashi wa Nebayota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ada wakalelela Esau Elifasa ne Basemata wakalela Luele, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oholibama wakalela Yeusha ne Yalama ne Kola. Aba mbana ba Esau bakamulelelabo mu buloba bua Kanana ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau wakangata bakashi bandi ne bana bandi ba balume ne bana bandi ba bakashi ne bantu bonso ba mu nsubu wandi, ne bimuna biandi, ne nyama yandi yonso, ne bintu bionso biakamueneye mu buloba bua Kanana, wakumuka kudi muakunyiʼandi Yakoba, wakaya ku buloba bukuabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua bintu biabo biakatamba bia bungi kabakamanya mua kushikama kaba kamue, ne buloba buakadibo bashikame buakadi bukese bualu bua bungi bua bimuna biabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau wakashikama mu mukuna wa Sei Esau udi Edome.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ei idi ndelanganyi ya Esau, nkambua wa Bena Edome ba mu mukuna wa Sei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Au mmena a bana balume ba Esau Elifasa, muana wa balume wa Ada, mukashi wa Esau, ne Luele muana wa Basemata, mukashi wa Esau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bana ba balume ba Elifasa bakadi Temana ne Omâ ne Sefo ne Gatama ne Kenaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timena wakadi mue na mudimu wa bakashi wa Elifasa, muana wa Esau, ne yeye wakalelela Elifasa Amaleka, aba mbana ba balume ba Ada, mukashi wa Esau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba mbana ba balume ba Luele Nahata ne Zela ne Shama ne Miza, aba mbana ba balume ba Basemata, mukashi wa Esau ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba mbana ba balume ba Oholibama, muana wa bakashi wa Ana muana wa bakashi wa Sibiona mukashi wa Esau, yeye wakalelela Esau Yeusha ne Yalama ne Kola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba mbakelenge ba bana ba balume ba Esau bana ba balume ba Elifasa, muanʼa bute wa Esau, bakadi mukelenge Temana, ne mu kelenge Oma ne mukelenge Sefo ne mukelenge Kanaza ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne mukelenge Kola ne mukelenge Gatama ne mukelenge Amaleka, aba mbakelenge bakaluhuka kudi Elifasa mu buloba bua Edome, aba mbana ba balume ba Ada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba mbana ba balume ba Luele, muana wa Esau: mukelenge Nahata ne mukelenge Zela ne mukelenge Shama ne mukelenge Miza, aba mbakelenge bakaluhuka kudi Luele mu buloba bua Edome, aba mbana ba balume ba Basemata, mukashi wa Esau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba mbana ba balume ba Oholibama, mukashi Wa Esau mukelenge Yeusha ne mukelenge Yalama ne mukelenge Kola, aba mbakelenge bakaluhuka kudi Oholibama, muana wa Ana, mukashi wa Esau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba mbana ba balume ba Esau, aba mbakelenge babo, eu udi Edome.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba mbana ba balume ba Seî, Muena Holi, bena buloba Lotana ne Shobala ne Sibiona ne Ana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne Dishona ne Eze ne Dishana, aba mbakelenge ba Bena Holi, bana ba Sei, mu buloba bua Edome. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bana ba Lotana bakadi Holi ne Hemana; Timena wakadi muanʼabo wa bakashi ne Lotana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba mbana ba Shobala Aluwana ne Manahata ne Ebala ne Shofo ne Onama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba mbana ba Sibiona Aya ne Ana muntu eu Ana wakasangana mishimi yakadi ihatuka mai a kahia mu tshihela, hakadiye udisha nyama ya mpunda ya tatuʼandi Sibiona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba mbana ba Ana Dishona ne Oholibama, muana mukashi wa Ana ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba mbana ba Dishona Hemedana ne Eshebane ne Yitelana ne Kelana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba mbana ba Eze Bilehana, ne Zâwana ne Akana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba mbana ba Dishana: Usa ne Alana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba mbakelenge bakaluhuka kudi Bena Holi, mukelenge Lotana ne mukelenge Shobala ne mukelenge Sibiona ne mukelenge Ana ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne mukelenge Dishona ne mukelenge Eze ne mukelenge Dishana, aba mbakelenge ba Bena Holi mu buloba bua Sei.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba mbakelenge bakakokesha ba mu buloba bua Edome, diambedi mukelenge kayi muanze kukokesha Bena Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bela, muana wa Beô, wakakokesha mu Edome, dina dia musoko wandi ne, Dinehaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.32"
            ]
          }
        },
